# 39. 🧱 server.js vs app.js

Humne jaan-bujhkar giant `index.js` nahi banaya.

### app.js

Application setup:

```text
Express
Middleware
Routes
Error middleware
```

### server.js

Server start:

```text
Database
Redis
Events
app.listen()
```

Simple:

```text
app.js
   ↓
Application ready

server.js
   ↓
Application start
```

---

# 40. 🧠 Controller vs Service vs Routes

```text
Request
  ↓
Routes
  ↓
Controller
  ↓
Service
  ↓
Database / Redis / External Service
```

### Routes

Decide karta hai:

```text
Kaunsi URL?
Kaunsa HTTP method?
Kaunsa controller?
```

### Controller

Request/response handle karta hai.

### Service

Actual business logic rakhta hai.

Isliye code manageable rehta hai.

---

# 41. 🔄 Complete Backend Request Flow

```text
CLIENT
  │
  ▼
NGINX / API GATEWAY
  │
  ▼
ROUTE
  │
  ▼
CONTROLLER
  │
  ▼
SERVICE
  │
  ├──► PostgreSQL
  │
  ├──► Redis
  │
  └──► Another Service
  │
  ▼
CONTROLLER
  │
  ▼
RESPONSE
  │
  ▼
CLIENT
```

