# 42. ☁️ AWS EC2

### Definition

**Amazon EC2 provides virtual servers in the cloud where applications can be deployed and run.**

Humne EC2 ko practice deployment ke liye use kiya.

Server:

```text
Ubuntu
   ↓
Docker
   ↓
Docker Compose
   ↓
Our Microservices
```

---

# 43. 🔐 SSH

### Definition

**SSH (Secure Shell) is a protocol used to securely connect to and manage a remote server.**

Flow:

```text
Windows PC
    │
    │ SSH
    ▼
AWS EC2 Ubuntu
```

Basic command:

```bash
ssh -i ecommerce-server-key.pem ubuntu@PUBLIC_IP
```

