# 46. 🔐 EC2 Environment Variables

GitHub par `.env` nahi rakha.

EC2 par manually:

```text
product-service/.env
order-service/.env
```

Docker Compose:

```yaml
env_file:
  - ./product-service/.env
```

Matlab:

```text
.env
 ↓
Docker Compose
 ↓
Container Environment
```

---

# 47. 💾 EC2 Disk Problem Jo Humne Solve Kiya

`t3.micro` par Docker build ke time memory/disk issue aaya.

First:

```text
Killed
code 137
```

Later:

```text
ENOSPC
no space left on device
```

Check:

```bash
df -h
```

Docker:

```bash
docker system df
```

Root disk ko:

```text
~8 GB
 ↓
20 GB
```

kiya.

Then partition/filesystem resize kiya:

```bash
sudo growpart /dev/nvme0n1 1
```

```bash
sudo resize2fs /dev/nvme0n1p1
```

Finally:

```text
~19 GB usable
```

Aur Docker build successful hua.

### Lesson

EC2 instance ki RAM aur disk dono deployment mein important hain.

---

# 48. 🐳 EC2 par Docker Permission Problem

Error:

```text
PermissionError: [Errno 13] Permission denied
```

Docker group add:

```bash
sudo usermod -aG docker $USER
```

Phir:

```bash
exit
```

SSH dobara login.

Uske baad Docker without sudo use kar sakte hain.

