# 49. 🌐 EC2 Nginx Flow

EC2 par:

```text
Internet
   │
   ▼
EC2 Public IP :80
   │
   ▼
Nginx Container :80
   │
   ├──► product-service:4001
   │
   └──► order-service:4002
```

Local mein:

```text
localhost:8080
```

EC2 mein:

```text
PUBLIC_IP:80
```

