# 60. 🧠 Final Mental Model

Agar mujhe pura project 30 seconds mein yaad karna ho:

```text
                    CLIENT
                      │
                      ▼
                 NGINX :8080
                  API GATEWAY
                      │
             ┌────────┴────────┐
             ▼                 ▼
        PRODUCT :4001      ORDER :4002
             │                 │
             ▼                 ▼
         Product DB         Order DB
             │                 │
             ▼                 ▼
           Redis             Redis
                               │
                               ▼
                        order.created
                               │
                    ┌──────────┴──────────┐
                    ▼                     ▼
              Reduce Stock            Send Email
```

Aur technology ka role:

```text
PostgreSQL → Permanent Data
Redis      → Cache + Events
Axios      → Direct Service Communication
Nginx      → Gateway
Docker     → Package/Run Services
Compose    → Manage Services Together
EC2        → Cloud Server
React      → Frontend
```

### ⭐ One-line project flow

```text
React → Nginx → Microservices → PostgreSQL/Redis
                         ↓
                    Redis Events
                         ↓
                  Stock + Email
```

**Ye mera E-Commerce Microservices project ka main map hai.**
Agar mujhe kabhi confusion ho ki "ye cheez kahan use hui thi?", pehle isi handbook ko dekhna hai.
